Release 1.0.0.

Changelog: 19-10-2026 00:49:02

Breaking. The PlayStation History page has no console pictures any more: the 28 pictures in images/consoles/ were
Sony's press and retail photos, which the suite has no rights to ship, and there are no replacements. The
thumbnails and the large view of a picture are gone; each console's name, in the totals as well as in the legacy, is
a link to pictures of it on the web. An update removes the pictures from the board (the installer replaces the
app's folder). The front page's tile no longer promises pictures.

