Changelog: 17-10-2026 09:05:54

Release 0.2.1.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 09:04:09

Fixed. The quiz questions are the owner's revised set (17-10-2026): 25 questions dropped, 110 reworded, 43 answers
or answer options corrected, and the true/false options spelled True and False throughout; 1,436 questions in the
same 11 categories, 230 of them true/false. The quiz tile on the front page counts the shipped questions instead
of naming a number, so it stays right when the file changes; the test of the shipped questions expects the new
count.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 08:56:40

Release 0.2.1.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 08:47:31

Fixed. The app's folder in the suite is apps/datstation (was apps/bazzite-datstation) and its package is datstation
(was bazzite_datstation): the suite's naming convention (owner, 17-10-2026), a short folder name and the package
named after the app without the Bazzite prefix, here the same word. With the folder go its key in the portal, its
chapter of the wiki (apps/datstation/), its installer test and its release tags: datstation-v<x.y.z> from the next
release on, which is also what the app's update check looks for. The installed app keeps its name, its launcher
bazzite-datstation, its settings, its scores and its folders; the portal moves its record of the installed copy
to the new key.

